# Benchmark Evaluation Report: Matchup `003_001` (V3 vs. Ichigo)

**Matchup `003_001` (Kamen Rider V3 vs. Ichigo) is officially PASSED**, comfortably exceeding the 50.0% benchmark threshold across all difficulty tiers with an aggregate **65.1% win rate** in live RIDER search mode.

---

## 1. Multi-Tier Benchmark Summary

